    a <ontology/EvidenceQuote/#resource> ;
    rdfs:label "Evidence for Iron Ore Including Chrome used in Metallurgy, Smelting, Brass & Tinplate: Mortimer (1823), General Commercial Dictionary, scan p. 226"@en ;
    <ontology/quoteText/#resource> "Coachmakers were incorporated into a company in the year 1677, in the reign of Charles II. COAK is used for exciting intense heats, for chemical purposes, or for smelting iron ore, and for operations in which common coal would be detrimental, as the drying of malt."@en ;
    <ontology/retrievalMode/#resource> "direct_sentence" .
